      "text": "$x^{2} y^{\\prime}+x y^{\\prime \\prime}-3 y=0$\r\nWhere $y^{\\prime} \\equiv \\frac{d y}{d x}, y^{\\prime \\prime} \\equiv \\frac{d^{2} y}{d x^{2}}$",
