  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "equation of ellipse centred at origin and have axes as the coordinate axes is\r\n$\\frac{x^{2}}{a^{2}}+\\frac{y^{2}}{b^{2}}=1$\r\n$\\Rightarrow \\frac{x}{a^{2}}+\\frac{y y^{\\prime}}{b^{2}}=0$\r\n$\\Rightarrow \\quad \\frac{-b^{2}}{a^{2}}=\\frac{y y^{\\prime}}{x}$\r\n$\\Rightarrow \\quad 0=\\frac{x\\left(y^{\\prime \\prime} y^{\\prime}+y^{\\prime 2}\\right)-y y^{\\prime}}{x^{2}}$\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/wbjee/TRL9q82T8mG6OMzCByQdhN0DjP90b8FoX1C9VsCvDZM.original.fullsize.png\">",
